publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T11:46:26.7967156Z               "id": "c96e2e74d0a221cdc87c1e923804abc2ed75f026",
publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T11:46:26.7968416Z               "message": "Add compatible organization member management\n\nCompatible clients could list organization people but could not retrieve one active member, change an organization role, remove a membership or change team assignments through the public routes. Reuse the native membership transaction and role guards so existing last-owner, CSRF and token-scope behavior remains authoritative. Team-role levels and pending-invitation item mutations remain explicit gaps rather than being silently approximated.",
